---
// CareGapCallout — before/after split visual for care gap extraction
// Visual spec: Page 3 §3 — "Every discharge summary contains actionable follow-up requirements"
---

<div class="cgc-wrapper">
  <div class="cgc-copy reveal">
    <p class="cgc-body">
      Every discharge summary contains actionable follow-up requirements. Most are never systematically
      acted on — because extracting them manually at scale isn't feasible. Our Care Continuity Agent
      reads the document and surfaces the care gap for your team to act on.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="cgc-split reveal">

    <!-- BEFORE panel: styled discharge summary block -->
    <div class="cgc-panel cgc-panel--before">
      <div class="cgc-panel-label">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
          <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
          <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
          <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
          <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/>
        </svg>
        Discharge Summary
      </div>

      <div class="discharge-doc">
        <div class="discharge-line discharge-line--header">
          <span class="doc-field">Patient:</span>
          <span class="doc-redacted doc-redacted--name"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="discharge-line">
          <span class="doc-field">Diagnosis:</span>
          <span class="doc-redacted doc-redacted--long"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="discharge-spacer"></div>
        <p class="discharge-text">
          Patient was admitted on <span class="doc-redacted doc-redacted--short"></span> for
          <span class="doc-redacted doc-redacted--medium"></span>.
          Post-operative recovery was unremarkable. Haemoglobin levels were within expected range.
          <span class="discharge-highlight">Follow-up in 6 weeks</span> for wound inspection
          and suture removal. Oral medications prescribed for 10 days.
        </p>
        <p class="discharge-text">
          Imaging findings: <span class="doc-redacted doc-redacted--long"></span>.
          <span class="discharge-highlight">Repeat imaging advised</span> in 3 months to
          monitor response. Patient counselled on dietary restrictions.
          <span class="doc-redacted doc-redacted--medium"></span> noted with no acute
          clinical significance. Please review at next consultation.
        </p>
        <div class="discharge-footer">
          <span class="doc-field">Treating Physician:</span>
          <span class="doc-redacted doc-redacted--name"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="before-label">Unstructured. Unread at scale.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Arrow -->
    <div class="cgc-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round">
        <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
        <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="cgc-arrow-label">Care Continuity Agent</span>
    </div>

    <!-- AFTER panel: structured care gap card -->
    <div class="cgc-panel cgc-panel--after">
      <div class="cgc-panel-label">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/>
          <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/>
        </svg>
        Structured Care Gap
      </div>

      <div class="care-gap-card">
        <div class="gap-row gap-row--header">
          <div class="gap-ref">
            <span class="gap-field">Patient Ref</span>
            <span class="gap-value">PT-2024-08441</span>
          </div>
          <span class="gap-urgency gap-urgency--medium">Medium priority</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gap-row">
          <span class="gap-field">Gap Type</span>
          <span class="gap-value gap-value--primary">Follow-up consultation</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gap-row">
          <span class="gap-field">Source</span>
          <span class="gap-value">Discharge summary — 2 Nov 2024</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gap-row">
          <span class="gap-field">Recommended Action</span>
          <span class="gap-value">Schedule wound inspection + suture removal within 6 weeks of discharge</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gap-row">
          <span class="gap-field">Secondary Gap</span>
          <span class="gap-value">Repeat imaging in 3 months — radiology review</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gap-divider"></div>

        <div class="gap-row gap-row--status">
          <span class="gap-field">Outreach Status</span>
          <span class="gap-status">
            <span class="gap-status-dot"></span>
            Pending team review
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="gap-action-row">
          <button class="gap-btn gap-btn--primary" disabled>Schedule Follow-up</button>
          <button class="gap-btn gap-btn--secondary" disabled>Dismiss</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="after-label">Structured. Actionable. Human-reviewed.</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .cgc-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .cgc-copy {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cgc-body {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Split layout */
  .cgc-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cgc-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .cgc-arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      justify-self: center;
    }
  }

  /* Panel shared */
  .cgc-panel {
    border-radius: 0.875rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .cgc-panel--before {
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .cgc-panel--after {
    background: var(--domain-cx-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--domain-cx-border);
  }

  .cgc-panel-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .cgc-panel--after .cgc-panel-label {
    color: var(--domain-cx);
  }

  /* Discharge summary mock */
  .discharge-doc {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .discharge-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .discharge-line--header {
    padding-bottom: 0.375rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .doc-field {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Redacted placeholder bars */
  .doc-redacted {
    display: inline-block;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--border-default);
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .doc-redacted--name   { width: 90px; }
  .doc-redacted--short  { width: 55px; }
  .doc-redacted--medium { width: 100px; }
  .doc-redacted--long   { width: 140px; }

  .discharge-spacer {
    height: 0.25rem;
  }

  .discharge-text {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .discharge-highlight {
    background: var(--domain-finops-muted);
    color: var(--domain-finops);
    padding: 0 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .discharge-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.375rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .before-label,
  .after-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .after-label {
    color: var(--domain-cx);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  /* Arrow between panels */
  .cgc-arrow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    color: var(--domain-cx);
  }

  .cgc-arrow-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--domain-cx);
    text-align: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Care gap card */
  .care-gap-card {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--domain-cx-border);
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    padding: 0.875rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .gap-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .gap-row--header {
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 0.375rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .gap-ref {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.125rem;
  }

  .gap-field {
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 90px;
  }

  .gap-value {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .gap-value--primary {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .gap-urgency {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .gap-urgency--medium {
    background: var(--domain-finops-muted);
    color: var(--domain-finops);
    border: 1px solid var(--domain-finops-border);
  }

  .gap-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .gap-row--status {
    align-items: center;
  }

  .gap-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--domain-cx);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .gap-status-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--domain-cx);
    animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50%       { opacity: 0.4; }
  }

  .gap-action-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .gap-btn {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 5px;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    font-family: inherit;
    border: 1px solid;
  }

  .gap-btn--primary {
    background: var(--domain-cx);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--domain-cx);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .gap-btn--secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    border-color: var(--border-default);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
